    "implementation_delta": "Remove sitecustomize and runtime-readiness/kernel-VFS harness sys.path injection of sibling checkouts. Replace Datasets tests-tree fixture loading with packaged Kit constructors in ipfs_kit_py.adversarial_assurance_store.normative_vectors. Profile G vectors no longer fall back to a monorepo sibling checkout. Hermetic source probes were measured_hermetic. Live IPFS and CLI/MCP/MCP++ parity stay typed unavailable (PCPR-026). Support-matrix generation stays typed unavailable (PCPR-027). This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
  },
